** BUILD SUCCEEDED **  (log: /tmp/415-build4.log)

App: /tmp/415-dd/Build/Products/Debug-iphonesimulator/FleetNotifier.app
Bundle id: com.corral.fleetnotifier (lowercase — simctl launch uses the
